<title>HONG KONG: Peking Apparel debuts at HK$1.50/share.</title>
<headline>Peking Apparel debuts at HK$1.50/share.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Hong Kong leather garments manufacturer and distributor Peking Apparel International Group Ltd made their trading debut at HK$1.50 per share compared to their issue price of HK$1.00.</p>
</text>
